# Checked byte for byte, so never converted at checkout (Windows'
# core.autocrlf=true would write CRLF and change their SHA-256):
# - the embedded vendor data, against its MANIFEST and MANIFEST.sig;
# - the built-in signing keys;
# - the signed test vectors.
# A pattern with a slash is anchored at the repository's root: moving one of
# these directories moves its line too. internal/gitattr checks it in the
# tests of ekroots and manifest.
ekroots/vendors/** -text
manifest/allowed_signers -text
manifest/testdata/** -text
